WEBVTT

00:06.250 --> 00:08.460
I'm the end of the line!

00:08.460 --> 00:11.920
Muster up everything you've got left
for the last fight of your life!

00:39.000 --> 00:40.830
Lightning Claw Skyrend!

00:42.170 --> 00:44.250
Move. Move.

00:44.250 --> 00:45.670
Move!

00:46.000 --> 00:47.750
How boring.

00:47.750 --> 00:54.460
Move. Move. Move. Move. Move.
Move. Move. Move. Move!

00:57.790 --> 00:59.130
Ragna!

00:59.130 --> 01:01.670
Wake up, Ragna!

01:03.210 --> 01:05.580
Wake up, Ragna!

01:10.670 --> 01:13.000
S-Silverware Princess?

01:13.000 --> 01:15.080
Yes, 'tis I.

01:18.630 --> 01:19.790
Silverware Princess?

01:19.790 --> 01:20.880
Wha-? You-

01:20.880 --> 01:21.830
So close!
Silverware Princess!<b></b>

01:21.830 --> 01:22.790
Your face is so close!

01:22.790 --> 01:24.000
Silverware Princess!

01:24.580 --> 01:25.420
Silver-

01:25.420 --> 01:27.670
You're way too close, you dashing rogue!

01:27.670 --> 01:29.080
Bwahhh!

01:29.500 --> 01:30.790
You're being entirely too bold!

01:30.790 --> 01:33.920
You must call me L-L-Lia
if you address me directly!

01:36.540 --> 01:37.630
Lia!

02:08.540 --> 02:10.420
Ikiru imi sae

02:10.420 --> 02:12.580
Ubaisatteitta

02:12.580 --> 02:14.790
Ibitsuna sekai o

02:14.790 --> 02:17.580
Zenbu kowasou to shiteita

02:17.580 --> 02:19.670
(Subete o hikikae ni)

02:19.670 --> 02:21.830
Chikara o motometa

02:21.830 --> 02:23.960
(Daishou no hate ni)

02:23.960 --> 02:27.000
Nani ga matteita toshitemo

02:27.420 --> 02:31.460
Mirai o kaeru tame ni

02:31.460 --> 02:34.500
Jibun o tokihanatte

02:34.500 --> 02:36.630
Kotae wa dare ni mo

02:36.630 --> 02:38.750
Wakari nado shinai

02:38.750 --> 02:40.580
Dakara jibun de

02:40.580 --> 02:42.880
Kirihiraite yukunda

02:43.170 --> 02:45.210
Aragai nagara

02:45.210 --> 02:47.460
Sagashite ita mono wa

02:47.460 --> 02:51.210
Kibou demo kiseki demo naku tada

02:51.210 --> 02:53.210
Boku wa ima

02:53.210 --> 02:58.790
Kimi to ikiru imi ga hoshii dake

03:12.330 --> 03:16.960
<b>Episode 18: End of the Battle to the Death</b>

03:17.750 --> 03:20.460
Where exactly are we?

03:20.460 --> 03:22.500
This is where we teleported to.

03:23.290 --> 03:24.750
It worked?

03:24.750 --> 03:26.170
Where is everyone else?

03:26.170 --> 03:27.960
Don't worry.

03:27.960 --> 03:29.960
Everyone is over that way.

03:29.960 --> 03:31.170
Follow me.

03:38.130 --> 03:42.250
Did you find Garm and Shin helpful?

03:42.630 --> 03:44.210
They saved me.

03:44.830 --> 03:47.420
They're both incredibly talented.

03:47.880 --> 03:50.880
They steadily grew stronger
during the battle.

03:51.500 --> 03:54.080
Before I knew it,
I was competing against them.

03:54.080 --> 03:58.000
I was able to draw out more of
my future power than usual.

03:58.750 --> 04:00.500
But of course.

04:00.960 --> 04:04.170
They are the chief swordsmen of my corps.

04:04.170 --> 04:05.380
Yeah.

04:06.830 --> 04:10.130
Gramps felt he had reached his limit.

04:10.670 --> 04:16.460
In terms of both age and ability,
he had no more hope of growing further.

04:16.460 --> 04:21.380
But he broke through that barrier
thanks to his exposure to your strength.

04:21.380 --> 04:25.130
Like a water pouring from a dam,

04:25.130 --> 04:28.500
his many years of hard work will
help him quickly make great strides.

04:28.500 --> 04:29.540
Yeah.

04:30.210 --> 04:36.250
And Shin has the greatest
raw talent in the corps.

04:36.250 --> 04:39.290
He would have grown stronger either way,

04:39.290 --> 04:41.710
but having a rival he wants to surpass

04:41.710 --> 04:44.670
will only increase the
momentum of his growth.

04:44.670 --> 04:48.580
He may even reach heights
he wouldn't have been able to otherwise.

04:49.000 --> 04:51.210
But it's not only those two.

04:51.210 --> 04:54.040
Everyone in my corps is magnificent.

04:55.540 --> 05:00.630
I had my eye on Ike
before he even joined the army.

05:00.630 --> 05:02.380
He's a highly capable man.

05:02.380 --> 05:05.580
Without him, the corps
wouldn't be able to operate.

05:06.000 --> 05:11.500
Chris was an incredible asset in this battle.

05:11.500 --> 05:15.290
He seems like a meathead,
but I think that's all show.

05:15.290 --> 05:18.040
At times, glimpses of
his intellect slip through.

05:18.460 --> 05:22.380
I knew Nazarena was very powerful,

05:22.380 --> 05:25.130
but I was a little taken aback
by her efforts in this battle.

05:25.130 --> 05:27.290
Didn't she kind of
steal the show back there?

05:28.170 --> 05:31.080
Fu is the grumpy perfectionist.

05:31.080 --> 05:33.960
It's said he's a half-dragon Thaumaturge,
and though he's a misanthrope,

05:33.960 --> 05:37.830
he takes good care of other people
and is well-liked by his subordinates.

05:37.830 --> 05:42.040
And his long-lost sister
is actually also in this corps.

05:42.040 --> 05:44.290
Fu hides that he is her older brother,

05:44.290 --> 05:46.790
but she is aware of the fact,
in all likelihood.

05:47.460 --> 05:52.790
You can't say Hesela and Greya are
naturally brimming with emotion.

05:52.790 --> 05:58.330
But there is no doubt they chose the corps
as their home and fought to protect it.

05:59.540 --> 06:02.790
I can't help but feel concerned for
Hesela now that she's alone.

06:02.790 --> 06:04.000
Huh?

06:08.790 --> 06:10.380
This is as far as I go.

06:11.290 --> 06:13.330
Go ahead without me.

06:13.330 --> 06:15.580
I have other matters to attend to.

06:15.580 --> 06:17.630
Other matters to attend to?

06:17.630 --> 06:18.790
Like what?

06:21.460 --> 06:23.750
I must forge a sword.

06:26.580 --> 06:30.000
Will it be from my head or heart?

06:30.000 --> 06:31.920
Or maybe from my soul?

06:32.670 --> 06:35.750
For as long as I can remember,

06:35.750 --> 06:38.170
I've had the image of
a single sword within me.

06:39.040 --> 06:41.580
Its outline is hazy and indefinite.

06:41.580 --> 06:44.420
It is nothing more than a sword
that I know to be a sword.

06:49.250 --> 06:50.630
It's name is...

06:50.630 --> 06:52.330
the Silver Comet.

06:56.290 --> 07:00.750
A long, long time ago, a silver star
flew in from the cosmos.

07:01.960 --> 07:05.580
It is the origin of all silver.

07:07.460 --> 07:12.290
To create a sword bearing the name of
this comet is the reason I was born.

07:12.790 --> 07:15.170
Even if I must die...

07:15.170 --> 07:17.830
I will do so.

07:17.830 --> 07:20.880
No matter what,
I'll create a sword worthy of you!

07:21.330 --> 07:22.330
Lia!

07:22.830 --> 07:24.130
But...

07:25.380 --> 07:29.790
All I'd like is for us
to see each other one last-

07:30.330 --> 07:34.130
Lia!

07:46.500 --> 07:47.960
It's okay.

07:48.460 --> 07:50.710
I still feel her.

07:57.460 --> 07:59.330
Princess...

08:13.880 --> 08:16.000
Hey, you inshignificant humansh!

08:16.500 --> 08:18.290
Jusht how long are you
gonna be depresshed

08:18.290 --> 08:20.210
becaushe tonsh of your friendsh
kicked the bucket?

08:20.210 --> 08:23.040
After that hairball-brained cat
and rinky-dink robot died,

08:23.040 --> 08:24.830
I didn't feel an ounshe of shadnessh!

08:24.830 --> 08:26.670
You are all sho wimpy!

08:29.670 --> 08:30.710
Mister Slime.

08:31.080 --> 08:34.250
You finally woke up, shtupid human!

08:34.250 --> 08:37.630
You're a real idiot shlacker,
shleeping for two whole daysh!

08:37.630 --> 08:40.710
Ash your punishment, do shomething
to fix theshe awful vibesh!

08:40.710 --> 08:43.500
Everyone'sh sho down in the dumps,
it makesh me wanna vomit!

08:54.080 --> 08:55.040
Um...

08:55.040 --> 08:56.210
Master Reaper!

08:56.920 --> 08:58.540
You woke up.

08:58.920 --> 09:00.540
What a relief.

09:00.540 --> 09:03.380
Could you please come with me?

09:03.380 --> 09:05.500
There's someone I'd like you to meet.

09:14.380 --> 09:16.250
How's Shin Cutlass?

09:16.250 --> 09:18.830
Shin human went off shomewhere on hish own!

09:19.210 --> 09:21.920
He hated that rain cloud of deshpair too!

09:24.250 --> 09:26.290
Dammit!

09:35.080 --> 09:36.380
Hey!

09:37.500 --> 09:40.710
How long do we gotta stay here?

09:41.250 --> 09:43.960
I apologize, but we have to
stay here a while longer.

09:43.960 --> 09:46.040
We have nowhere near enough food!

09:46.040 --> 09:48.790
Sir, my child has a fever.

09:48.790 --> 09:50.080
Can you give me any medicine?

09:50.080 --> 09:51.830
I'll bring you some later.

09:51.830 --> 09:53.580
Please let me pass through.

09:54.210 --> 09:56.880
We need more, or we'll all die!

09:56.880 --> 09:58.330
Please!

09:58.330 --> 10:00.170
Hey! Where are you going?

10:00.710 --> 10:03.130
It's always the same with you!

10:03.130 --> 10:05.380
We shouldn't have followed you!

10:05.670 --> 10:09.380
We managed to teleport
six hundred civilians.

10:09.380 --> 10:12.500
There are several other camps
besides this one.

10:12.500 --> 10:15.250
About eighty members of the corps lived,
but only a few can move.

10:15.250 --> 10:18.830
As it stands, we can't attend to
everything that needs to be done.

10:20.040 --> 10:21.040
Oh!

10:21.290 --> 10:25.000
Thinking about it, you didn't have a
chance to eat anything after coming to.

10:25.000 --> 10:26.130
Huh?

10:26.130 --> 10:27.250
Apologies.

10:27.250 --> 10:30.210
I wasn't being attentive at all.

10:30.210 --> 10:32.380
Let's go back and eat first.

10:32.380 --> 10:34.580
What'sh gotten into you all of a shudden?

10:34.580 --> 10:37.420
All we have are preserved military rations.

10:37.790 --> 10:39.420
U-um.

10:39.420 --> 10:42.250
I'm more worried about you, Ike.

10:43.290 --> 10:44.500
I'm...

10:46.170 --> 10:48.170
I'm fine.

10:49.210 --> 10:52.040
Now, I just want to do something.

10:52.040 --> 10:53.710
It doesn't matter what.

10:56.250 --> 10:58.460
If I stop now...

10:59.000 --> 11:02.580
I don't think I'll ever be able
to do anything again.

11:03.670 --> 11:08.080
At least until she takes
the citizens off our hands...

11:08.080 --> 11:09.580
I must...

11:09.790 --> 11:11.790
I must act in Her Highness's stead.

11:14.630 --> 11:16.460
Listen to me, Ike.

11:16.670 --> 11:18.540
I've felt...

11:18.540 --> 11:22.460
I don't know how to explain it,
and this is just what I've felt, but...

11:23.250 --> 11:24.500
Lia is-

11:24.500 --> 11:25.630
Oh?

11:26.500 --> 11:28.420
Are you the Reaper?

11:30.750 --> 11:32.880
I see you've awoken.

11:33.830 --> 11:35.540
Praise the holy guide.

11:35.540 --> 11:36.710
I am-

11:39.040 --> 11:39.790
Ul...

11:40.330 --> 11:41.500
...ti...

11:41.500 --> 11:41.960
...matia!

11:41.960 --> 11:43.420
What in the-?
...matia!<b></b>

11:43.420 --> 11:44.130
...matia!

11:44.750 --> 11:45.500
What have you done?

11:45.500 --> 11:46.750
What have you done?
That's Ultimatia!<b></b>

11:46.750 --> 11:47.960
That's Ultimatia!

11:47.960 --> 11:50.080
The Winged Monarch!

11:50.290 --> 11:51.330
No!

11:51.330 --> 11:53.170
She's the Solar-

11:56.540 --> 11:58.040
How startling.

11:58.040 --> 12:00.420
I did not foresee that
I'd be killed so suddenly.

12:00.420 --> 12:02.540
You were incredibly quick.

12:02.540 --> 12:04.580
So, the rumor that your battle
against the Winged Monarch

12:04.580 --> 12:06.540
in the capital ended in a draw...

12:06.540 --> 12:07.380
Yes.

12:07.380 --> 12:09.330
...may be true after all.

12:09.790 --> 12:12.960
I've stopped time for now,
but what shall we do?

12:12.960 --> 12:14.880
Should I rewind time?

12:15.080 --> 12:16.960
That won't be necessary.

12:16.960 --> 12:20.250
There is still an ample number of me here.

12:20.250 --> 12:22.170
Who shall take her place?

12:22.830 --> 12:24.170
In that case,

12:24.170 --> 12:26.880
since I am the oldest me,

12:27.380 --> 12:29.210
I shall.

12:30.290 --> 12:32.290
Their faces are all the same?

12:32.290 --> 12:34.080
Twin humansh?

12:35.630 --> 12:36.540
No.

12:36.920 --> 12:39.000
We're all identical.

12:40.040 --> 12:44.670
You harbor exceptional fury for
the dragon who has this face.

12:45.080 --> 12:48.330
But I am not the Winged Monarch.

12:48.330 --> 12:52.540
I am a Dragon Scourge of
the Solarian Church.

12:52.540 --> 12:54.670
Carula, the Saint of Time.

12:54.670 --> 12:57.920
Just like you, my aim is
to destroy all of dragonkind.

12:57.920 --> 13:01.170
I look forward to working with you, Reaper.

13:02.380 --> 13:04.040
Please forgive him!

13:04.040 --> 13:07.330
I'm aware this isn't a matter
one can simply just forgive,

13:07.330 --> 13:09.540
but please forgive him.

13:10.000 --> 13:12.750
He was confused because he just woke up!

13:12.750 --> 13:15.580
Besides, I'm the one who forced him
to come with me here.

13:15.580 --> 13:18.670
Please, punish me instead of him!

13:19.580 --> 13:22.750
I do not feel particularly
inclined to punish him.

13:22.750 --> 13:26.290
If what you say about
the battle in Lese is true,

13:26.290 --> 13:29.540
then he is also a miracle
bestowed upon us by God.

13:30.210 --> 13:33.540
The value of one of me
is nowhere near his value.

13:34.830 --> 13:37.540
Oh, yeah. That's right!

13:37.540 --> 13:39.080
I remember now!

13:39.080 --> 13:43.170
They have the same face and magic,
but they're not dragons.

13:43.170 --> 13:46.540
Thus, as you requested,
you may die instead.

13:48.170 --> 13:51.420
Even though I have replacements,
since I'm a miracle of God,

13:51.420 --> 13:54.880
it would be disrespectful to God
to not demand some sort of atonement

13:54.880 --> 13:56.630
for the murder of one of me.

13:56.630 --> 14:00.130
There are so many of them in the
Solarian Church, it makes me sick.

14:00.380 --> 14:03.210
Now, please grit your teeth
and kill yourself at once.

14:04.290 --> 14:07.670
Ugh! He jusht barfed! Dishgushting!

14:11.080 --> 14:13.130
Bring her back!

14:14.170 --> 14:16.460
I'm sorry for killing the wrong person.

14:16.460 --> 14:17.630
I apologize.

14:18.420 --> 14:21.630
Make it to where it never happened!

14:21.630 --> 14:23.130
I know you can!

14:23.460 --> 14:25.460
We are capable of doing such a thing,

14:25.460 --> 14:29.330
but it consumes a lot of magic power
so it's not worth it for one-

14:29.880 --> 14:33.380
If you kill Ike,
I'll kill every single one of you.

14:36.000 --> 14:37.580
All right then.

14:38.960 --> 14:40.460
Heed me, time...

14:48.830 --> 14:49.710
Huh?

14:49.710 --> 14:51.920
Was I dead?

14:51.920 --> 14:55.130
Yes, the Reaper killed you.

14:55.130 --> 14:56.670
What are we to do?

14:56.670 --> 14:59.460
Should I give back
the position of Carula to you?

14:59.460 --> 15:00.710
No.

15:00.710 --> 15:05.670
I don't know what happened while
I was dead, so you should continue.

15:05.670 --> 15:07.290
Understood.

15:07.670 --> 15:11.540
Some time ago, I asked Her Highness

15:11.540 --> 15:14.670
why she did not want to become
a Dragon Scourge.

15:15.880 --> 15:18.920
I do not wish to be one of them.

15:19.670 --> 15:21.380
I understand now.

15:21.380 --> 15:22.750
They're all...

15:22.750 --> 15:23.920
lunatics!

15:30.040 --> 15:33.040
These are the ruins of a city
from the old civilization

15:33.040 --> 15:35.580
that the Solarian Church
cares for and preserves.

15:35.580 --> 15:38.000
It is protected by layer
upon layer of barriers

15:38.000 --> 15:40.670
that hinder dragons from
drawing anywhere near it.

15:40.960 --> 15:42.420
Let's try this once more.

15:42.420 --> 15:45.790
How are you feeling now, Master Ragna?

15:46.290 --> 15:49.000
Y-you healed me?

15:49.000 --> 15:50.830
Th-thanks.

15:51.960 --> 15:53.790
My pleasure.

15:53.790 --> 15:56.710
That being said,
I couldn't fully heal you.

15:57.330 --> 16:01.460
You have a highly unique constitution.

16:02.290 --> 16:04.500
Magic is rather ineffective against you,

16:04.500 --> 16:08.670
so the more your strength recovers,
the less effective magic is.

16:08.670 --> 16:13.000
I just barely brought you from
death's door to being severely wounded.

16:13.000 --> 16:16.960
Using any further magic would've frozen you.

16:18.250 --> 16:20.540
Exactly like a silver sword!

16:23.670 --> 16:27.790
Her voice, her tone,
even her mannerisms...

16:29.210 --> 16:32.210
Could you cover up your face?

16:32.210 --> 16:34.130
Does it cause you discomfort?

16:34.130 --> 16:35.290
I'm gonna throw up.

16:35.290 --> 16:39.040
So that's just how much
you hate that thing?

16:39.040 --> 16:40.420
Splendid!

16:40.420 --> 16:43.960
Yeah, how fantastic. Just cover your-

16:46.580 --> 16:48.750
I've brought beverages.

16:55.290 --> 16:57.830
You're Lia's...

16:58.420 --> 17:01.420
She's a member of the Solarian Church.

17:02.130 --> 17:04.130
Outside of the church's territory,

17:04.130 --> 17:08.500
people who possess special abilities
are often persecuted.

17:08.500 --> 17:13.630
The church has sent agents to many
places to prevent this persecution.

17:13.920 --> 17:17.580
Her mission was to recruit
a potential miracle of God,

17:17.580 --> 17:21.580
the Silverware Princess of Lese,
to join the church.

17:22.130 --> 17:26.000
By all outward appearances,
she's the princess's tutor.

17:26.000 --> 17:30.040
And if she were to get unruly,
her assassin.

17:30.040 --> 17:32.630
In truth, she was to gain
the princess's trust,

17:32.630 --> 17:35.460
and when there was no longer
a place for her in Lese,

17:35.460 --> 17:38.960
she would act as the bridge that
brings her to the Solarian Church.

17:42.960 --> 17:44.960
But she failed to do so.

17:45.420 --> 17:48.920
Now, she is awaiting punishment
from her home country.

17:49.790 --> 17:51.540
Did Her Highness know?

17:52.040 --> 17:55.670
You had a special position
within the corps.

17:56.130 --> 18:00.420
I always thought the two of you
were good friends!

18:01.080 --> 18:04.080
It is difficult to predict her thoughts.

18:04.420 --> 18:05.460
But...

18:08.380 --> 18:12.880
If she knew, I don't think
she would have forgiven me.

18:13.710 --> 18:15.130
Excuse me.

18:20.540 --> 18:23.290
Your tea is getting cold.

18:23.540 --> 18:25.080
I'm not in the mood for tea!

18:25.540 --> 18:27.330
I see.

18:27.330 --> 18:29.580
If you don't want it, I'll shlurp it up!

18:32.080 --> 18:36.250
Then let me ask you frankly, Master Ragna.

18:36.250 --> 18:38.630
Will you become a Dragon Scourge?

18:38.630 --> 18:39.630
I won't.

18:39.630 --> 18:44.250
Your constitution seems to truly be
a miracle of the Sun God!

18:44.250 --> 18:49.000
The Solarian Church is always seeking
individuals like yourself.

18:49.000 --> 18:50.210
Not happening.

18:50.210 --> 18:52.460
Sho hot!
Based on your feats in Lese,<b></b>

18:52.460 --> 18:55.540
Ouch, puru! Ouch, puru!
you would undoubtedly be able to<b>
</b>become a Dragon Scourge!<b></b>

18:55.540 --> 18:58.290
I assure you that the benefits
are excellent indeed!

18:58.290 --> 18:59.420
Don't want 'em!

18:59.710 --> 19:04.920
We cannot take in the refuges from Lese
if you do not join the church.

19:06.830 --> 19:11.580
For many years, the church has been
encouraging the Silverware Princess

19:11.580 --> 19:13.580
to become a Dragon Scourge.

19:14.040 --> 19:19.040
She was committed to joining the church,
on the condition that we

19:19.040 --> 19:22.540
accept the refuges from the last attack
by the Winged Bloodline.

19:23.170 --> 19:25.000
But then this happened.

19:26.960 --> 19:28.710
It's a shame.

19:28.710 --> 19:31.920
If we at least had her head,
we could have done something.

19:40.500 --> 19:43.210
She did not manage to make it here.

19:43.540 --> 19:48.000
Thus, we cannot take in
the refugees either.

19:48.330 --> 19:51.080
Unless you join us instead.

19:55.920 --> 19:59.000
Then why didn't you help us?

19:59.460 --> 20:02.080
If you couldn't help us,

20:02.080 --> 20:06.040
you could have at least prepared
the magic we needed to teleport!

20:06.040 --> 20:07.920
If you had...

20:07.920 --> 20:09.750
This wouldn't have happened!

20:10.420 --> 20:14.000
The value of a person is
determined by their achievements.

20:14.330 --> 20:16.630
After all, she was a candidate.

20:16.630 --> 20:18.500
If one is to become a Dragon Scourge,

20:18.500 --> 20:23.000
they must show adequate proof
they're a miracle of God.

20:23.920 --> 20:26.250
She was not able to do so.

20:26.250 --> 20:27.920
But you were.

20:27.920 --> 20:31.040
That's to say, this is the Sun God's will!

20:31.540 --> 20:34.250
I don't give a crap about your Sun God!

20:34.250 --> 20:38.210
Everyone receives God's blessings,
whether we're aware of it or not.

20:38.460 --> 20:42.080
Silver. Sunlight.
They are all divine blessings.

20:44.170 --> 20:47.420
Then why doesn't he come down and
destroy the dragons already!

20:49.540 --> 20:51.540
You're taking in the refugees.

20:52.040 --> 20:54.880
And how would that benefit
the Solarian Church?

20:55.210 --> 20:57.080
I'll hunt down the Winged Monarch.

20:59.210 --> 21:03.000
I will erase your stain from this world.

21:05.960 --> 21:09.710
That would be marvelous.

21:13.540 --> 21:14.750
Reaper!

21:16.130 --> 21:17.580
I'm sorry...

21:17.580 --> 21:20.960
I'm sorry I used you as a bargaining chip!

21:20.960 --> 21:24.210
I think you're just doing
what you gotta do.

21:24.210 --> 21:25.880
Don't worry about it.

21:26.130 --> 21:28.830
You sherioushly need to get shome shleep!

21:29.210 --> 21:30.420
Thank you.

21:30.960 --> 21:32.670
Incidentally, where are you going?

21:35.790 --> 21:37.000
To poop.

21:38.250 --> 21:40.330
Jusht how far are you going?

21:40.880 --> 21:43.880
Shtop now and get it over with,
pukey-poopy human!

21:46.630 --> 21:48.040
Here we are.

21:52.080 --> 21:54.250
Thish ish a reshtroom?

21:56.250 --> 21:57.380
Puru?

21:59.080 --> 22:00.500
I know thish shmell!

22:02.670 --> 22:04.830
Mashter Crimshon!

22:04.830 --> 22:06.250
You're late.

22:06.540 --> 22:08.130
You took a beating.

22:08.130 --> 22:10.330
First, let's get you patched up.

22:25.920 --> 22:32.960
Honshou wa kakushiteiru tsubasa no uchi ni,
mudana agaki to shitte mo

22:32.960 --> 22:39.670
Kodoku kara naru itami sae taete izure
tayorinai mirai, kibou

22:39.670 --> 22:43.460
Raisan o kumo ni suru kuuchuusen,
yokkyuu oshikorosu koujou ja

22:43.460 --> 22:46.750
Ibitsuna katachi shika umi enai

22:46.750 --> 22:53.710
Akegata, higashi kara noboru hikari o
watashi no mono ni nante wagamama

22:53.710 --> 22:57.830
Aimaina kotoba ja todokanai hodo

22:57.830 --> 23:06.170
Kurakute mabushii tokoro made
shinjitai to dou ieba ii

23:06.830 --> 23:11.330
Hada de kanjita ima iki o tsuiteiru koto sae

23:11.330 --> 23:15.460
Houridaseru youna netsu ga mi o yaite mo

23:15.460 --> 23:22.040
Ano machi e kaeru tame
no hane ga mou sukoshi oshii

23:22.040 --> 23:29.540
Ah, kono mama doko made mo iketara
soko wa atatakai basho de

23:29.540 --> 23:34.250
Fureru ni wa mada yawarakai mama da
